cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, cite its URL, access date, and exact Git commit."
title: "NSE India Daily OHLC, Bhavcopy and Delivery Data"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "olo-labs contributors"
abstract: >-
  A date-partitioned CSV archive of National Stock Exchange of India daily
  security-level OHLC prices, bhavcopy trading statistics, traded quantity,
  turnover, deliverable quantity, and delivery percentage from September 2019
  onward. Apache-2.0 applies to original repository code and documentation;
  underlying NSE market data is subject to separate rights and policies.
repository-code: "https://github.com/olo-labs/olo-testdata-nse-day-delivery-candle"
url: "https://github.com/olo-labs/olo-testdata-nse-day-delivery-candle"
keywords:
  - NSE India
  - OHLC
  - bhavcopy
  - delivery data
  - historical market data
  - Indian stock market
  - CSV dataset
  - backtesting
